            "designMd": "---\nname: CourtPass Midnight\ncolors:\n  surface: '#1A2620'\n  surface-dim: '#0b1610'\n  surface-bright: '#24322A'\n  surface-container-lowest: '#06100b'\n  surface-container-low: '#131e18'\n  surface-container: '#17221c'\n  surface-container-high: '#212c26'\n  surface-container-highest: '#2c3730'\n  on-surface: '#F4F7F5'\n  on-surface-variant: '#8B9991'\n  inverse-surface: '#d9e6dc'\n  inverse-on-surface: '#28332c'\n  outline: '#2C3D35'\n  outline-variant: '#3f4941'\n  surface-tint: '#80d9a4'\n  primary: '#80d9a4'\n  on-primary: '#003920'\n  primary-container: '#1b7a4e'\n  on-primary-container: '#acffcb'\n  inverse-primary: '#006d42'\n  secondary: '#ffb596'\n  on-secondary: '#581e00'\n  secondary-container: '#b74701'\n  on-secondary-container: '#ffe7de'\n  tertiary: '#ffb3b5'\n  on-tertiary: '#5d161f'\n  tertiary-container: '#a85056'\n  on-tertiary-container: '#ffe8e8'\n  error: '#ffb4ab'\n  on-error: '#690005'\n  error-container: '#93000a'\n  on-error-container: '#ffdad6'\n  primary-fixed: '#9cf5bf'\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#80d9a4'\n  on-primary-fixed: '#002111'\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#005231'\n  secondary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#ffb596'\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#360f00'\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#7c2e00'\n  tertiary-fixed: '#ffdada'\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ffb3b5'\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#40010c'\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#7a2d34'\n  background: '#0b1610'\n  on-background: '#d9e6dc'\n  surface-variant: '#2c3730'\ntypography:\n  headline-xl:\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\n    fontSize: 32px\n    fontWeight: '700'\n    lineHeight: 40px\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\n  headline-lg:\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\n    fontSize: 24px\n    fontWeight: '700'\n    lineHeight: 32px\n    letterSpacing: -0.01em\n  headline-md:\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\n    fontSize: 20px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 28px\n  body-lg:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 18px\n    fontWeight: '400'\n    lineHeight: 28px\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 16px\n    fontWeight: '400'\n    lineHeight: 24px\n  body-sm:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 14px\n    fontWeight: '400'\n    lineHeight: 20px\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 14px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 16px\n    letterSpacing: 0.02em\n  label-sm:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 12px\n    fontWeight: '500'\n    lineHeight: 16px\nrounded:\n  sm: 0.25rem\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\n  md: 0.75rem\n  lg: 1rem\n  xl: 1.5rem\n  full: 9999px\nspacing:\n  container-max: 390px\n  margin-edge: 20px\n  gutter: 12px\n  stack-sm: 8px\n  stack-md: 16px\n  stack-lg: 24px\n  stack-xl: 32px\n---\n\n## Brand & Style\nThe design system transitions into a refined, high-performance **Refined Dark Mode** aesthetic. It moves away from the airy, daytime feel of the original system toward a \"Night Match\" atmosphere—evoking the prestige of professional evening padel tournaments under stadium lights.\n\nThe style is **Modern Minimalist** with a focus on **Tonal Depth**. By utilizing a deep obsidian-green foundation, the UI reduces eye strain and allows the vibrant primary and secondary accents to \"pop\" with functional energy. The brand personality remains professional, sporty, and premium, but adds a layer of exclusive, high-tech sophistication suitable for a top-tier athletic club.\n\n## Colors\nThe palette is optimized for high-contrast legibility in low-light environments, using a deep forest-black as the base.\n\n- **Primary (#1B7A4E):** The signature \"Padel Green.\" High-visibility against the dark background, used for primary calls to action and success states.\n- **Secondary (#E86A2A):** \"Clay Orange.\" Used for high-priority interactive elements, active highlights, and urgent notifications.\n- **Background (#0F1A14):** A deep, desaturated green-black that provides a sophisticated foundation.\n- **Surface (#1A2620):** A slightly lighter tier used for cards and containers to create a sense of physical layering.\n- **On-Surface (#F4F7F5):** An off-white tint that ensures maximum readability without the harsh glare of pure white.\n\n## Typography\nThe system maintains its dual-font strategy. **DM Sans** provides a geometric, athletic punch for headlines, while **Inter** delivers utilitarian precision for data-heavy booking flows. \n\nIn this dark mode iteration, font weights for body text are strictly maintained to ensure \"ink spread\" (the visual bleeding of light text on dark backgrounds) does not compromise legibility. Labels use uppercase styling and increased tracking where necessary to provide a technical, \"scorecard\" feel.\n\n## Layout & Spacing\nThe layout adheres to a **Fixed-Fluid** model centered on a 390px mobile-first viewport. \n\nThe rhythm is governed by a 4px baseline grid. A consistent 20px edge margin creates a \"safe zone\" for interaction. Vertical density is managed through a \"Stack\" system: 16px for related content within a card, and 24px-32px to separate distinct sections (e.g., \"Available Courts\" from \"Your Bookings\"). Bottom-anchored actions ensure high ergonomic reachability for one-handed operation.\n\n## Elevation & Depth\nElevation in this system is conveyed through **Tonal Stepping** rather than heavy shadows.\n\n1.  **Level 0 (Base):** `#0F1A14` (The court floor).\n2.  **Level 1 (Surface):** `#1A2620` (Cards, list items).\n3.  **Level 2 (High Surface):** `#24322A` (Active items, modals, hovered states).\n\nFor floating elements like \"Book Now\" sticky buttons, use a **Glow-tinted Shadow**: a soft blur with a 15% opacity primary color (`#1B7A4E`) to simulate the way stadium lights reflect off the court surface.\n\n## Shapes\nThe shape language uses a \"Rounded\" philosophy (8px/0.5rem base) to maintain the balance between professional precision and approachable sportiness. \n\n- **Large Cards/Modals:** 16px (`rounded-lg`) for a soft, premium feel.\n- **Interactive Buttons/Inputs:** 8px (`rounded-md`) for a crisp, functional appearance.\n- **Status Tags/Chips:** Full pill-shaped (`rounded-full`) to differentiate them from structural layout components.\n\n## Components\n- **Buttons:** Primary buttons are 56px height, solid `#1B7A4E` with `#F4F7F5` text. Secondary buttons are outlined with a 1.5px stroke of the primary color and no fill.\n- **Cards:** Surface-container `#1A2620` with a subtle 1px border of `#2C3D35`. Avoid solid black backgrounds; use the surface green-tint to maintain depth.\n- **Chips (Time Slots):** Unselected states are `#24322A` (surface-bright) with a thin border. Selected state uses the Secondary Orange `#E86A2A` to signify a \"locked-in\" choice.\n- **Input Fields:** 48px height with a `#0F1A14` (background) fill to create a \"recessed\" look against the card surface.\n- **Progress Indicators:** Use the Primary Green for linear trackers. For \"Low Availability,\" use the Secondary Orange to spark immediate action.\n- **Bottom Navigation:** Solid `#1A2620` with a subtle blur backdrop. Active icons are highlighted in Primary Green with a small 4px dot indicator.",
