            "prompt": "A dark mode desktop landing page for CourtPass, a padel booking platform in Sheikh Zayed, Egypt. \n\nBackground: #0F1A14. \nCards: #1A2620. \nAccents: Emerald Green (#1B7A4E) for primary actions and Orange (#E86A2A) for promos/alerts. \n\nLayout:\n1. Hero section with high-quality padel court photography {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_15}} and 'Book. Pay. Play.' messaging.\n2. 'How it works' section with three feature cards (Pick slot, Pay, Pass).\n3. 'Morning Promo' banner using the orange accent color.\n4. 'Today's Availability' section with court cards showing available time slots.\n5. A 'Staff Admin' section with a data table showing recent bookings, ensuring high contrast and readability for text on the #1A2620 card background.\n\nConsistent with the professional, sporty aesthetic of the light mode version {{DATA:SCREEN:SCREEN_3}}.",
