      "text": "I've created the dark mode desktop version of the CourtPass landing page. \n\n### Design Choices:\n- **Color Palette**: Implemented the #0F1A14 background and #1A2620 card surfaces as requested, creating a premium \"midnight\" feel that reduces eye strain while maintaining brand identity.\n- **Accents**: Used the Emerald Green (#1B7A4E) for primary CTA buttons and success states, and the Orange (#E86A2A) for the high-visibility promotion banners.\n- **Admin Tables**: Designed the staff tables with high-contrast typography and subtle borders to ensure data remains perfectly readable against the dark card backgrounds.\n- **Consistency**: Maintained the established layout from your light mode version, including the hero messaging and court availability grid, to ensure a seamless experience for users switching between modes.\n\nWould you like to adjust the contrast for the admin tables further, or shall we move on to the mobile version of this dark theme?"
