            "prompt": "A high-fidelity desktop login screen for 'CourtPass' padel booking. \n\nDesign Specifications:\n- Device: Desktop (1440px)\n- Theme: Dark Mode\n- Colors: Background #0F1A14, Cards/Containers #1A2620, Accents #1B7A4E (Emerald) and #E86A2A (Orange).\n- Content: A central login card for staff and members. Fields for Phone Number and Password. Primary 'Log in' button in #1B7A4E. 'Forgot password?' link.\n- Branding: Include the CourtPass logo {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_20}}.\n- Admin/Staff Context: Include a subtle 'Staff Portal' or 'Admin Login' toggle or link with high-contrast, readable text for accessibility.\n- Visuals: Use a subtle background treatment or a small inset image of the Sheikh Zayed padel court {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_19}} to establish the luxury club atmosphere.\n\nMaintain the typography and spacing defined in {{DATA:DESIGN_SYSTEM:DESIGN_SYSTEM_1}}.\n## Available Images\nYou MUST include the following images in this design. You must reference them\nby putting their exact placeholder IDs in `src` attributes or CSS\n`background-image` rules. Do NOT use external URLs or generate new\nplaceholders. Preserve these IDs exactly as written. Read each image's\nDescription to understand its subject, intended section, and visual role.\n\n- {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_19}}\n  Description: Professional, high-quality photograph of a modern outdoor padel court with blue turf and glass walls, located in a clean architectural setting in Sheikh Zayed, Egypt. Bright daylight, luxury sports club feel. Used as a background image with a light green overlay.\n  Dimensions: 1264x848\n  Aspect Ratio: 1.49\n- {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_20}}\n  Description: CourtPass logo: A minimal padel racket icon followed by the wordmark 'CourtPass' in DM Sans. Professional, sporty, and clean. Colors: #1B7A4E and #0F1A14.\n  Dimensions: 1024x1024\n  Aspect Ratio: 1.00\n",
