      "text": "I've designed the **CourtPass login desktop dark** screen, specifically tailored for your Sheikh Zayed location. \n\n### Design Decisions\n- **Premium Dark Aesthetic**: Used your requested `#0F1A14` for the background and `#1A2620` for the central login container, creating a sophisticated depth that mirrors a luxury night-match atmosphere.\n- **Brand Accents**: The primary \"Log in\" action uses the signature `#1B7A4E` emerald, while the `#E86A2A` orange is used for critical alerts or specific highlights to ensure high visibility.\n- **Staff Admin Readiness**: Optimized the typography and input field contrasts to ensure staff can navigate the portal quickly and accurately, even in low-light environments.\n- **Local Identity**: Integrated the Sheikh Zayed court imagery and the official wordmark to maintain brand continuity across all touchpoints.\n\nHow does the contrast feel for the staff portal elements? I can sharpen the borders or increase the text weight if needed."
