      "text": "I've created the **CourtPass registration screen** for mobile in light mode. \n\n### Design Choices:\n- **Visual Foundation:** Used the `#F4F7F5` background with elevated white cards (`#FFFFFF`) to create a crisp, professional sports aesthetic.\n- **Brand Identity:** Integrated the **DM Sans** typeface for headings and **Inter** for form labels and inputs, ensuring excellent readability and a premium feel.\n- **Color Palette:** Applied `#1B7A4E` to the primary \"Create account\" action to maintain brand consistency with the existing CourtPass design system.\n- **User Flow:** Included a clear path for existing users with a \"Log in\" link at the bottom and a simple, focused three-field registration form.\n\nThe screen is now available on your canvas. Would you like to add a \"Success\" confirmation screen or proceed to the court discovery experience?"
