      "text": "I've created the dark mode desktop registration screen for CourtPass Sheikh Zayed.\n\n### Design Decisions\n- **Visual Identity**: Implemented the deep midnight green (`#0F1A14`) for the background and darker forest green (`#1A2620`) for the registration card to create a premium, high-contrast aesthetic.\n- **Accents**: Used the signature CourtPass green (`#1B7A4E`) for the primary action button and subtle accents to maintain brand consistency with the mobile app.\n- **Layout**: Utilized a clean, centered registration card layout with the high-quality padel court photography as a background to ground the experience in the physical location.\n- **Form Design**: The registration form is optimized for readability with Egypt-specific placeholders and clear typography.\n\nDoes this dark mode version align with the \"Join the Club\" feel you're looking for, or should we adjust the transparency levels of the card?"
