      "text": "I've designed the \"My Bookings\" mobile screen for CourtPass, following your light mode specifications for Sheikh Zayed.\n\n### Design Highlights:\n- **Visual Hierarchy**: Used the `#F4F7F5` background with elevated white cards to create clear separation between bookings.\n- **Brand Consistency**: Applied the `#1B7A4E` primary green for the \"Ready to play\" status and main actions, ensuring a cohesive sporty feel.\n- **Navigation & Utility**: Integrated the `+` book button in the header for quick access, and used a tabbed interface to switch between **Upcoming** and **Past** bookings.\n- **Booking Details**: Each card includes essential info like court name, time slot, and location, with a prominent \"View pass\" button for immediate use at the club.\n\nHow does this look for the mobile experience? We could also explore the dark mode version or design the digital pass itself."
