      "text": "I've created the dark mode registration page for CourtPass Sheikh Zayed. \n\n**Design Highlights:**\n*   **Deep Contrast:** Applied your specified #0F1A14 for the main background and #1A2620 for the registration card to create a modern, premium dark aesthetic.\n*   **Brand Continuity:** Integrated your signature green (#1B7A4E) for primary actions and orange (#E86A2A) for highlights, ensuring consistency with the brand's visual identity.\n*   **Visual Balance:** Used the high-quality padel court photography as a background layer with a subtle gradient overlay to keep the focus on the registration form while maintaining an athletic, high-end atmosphere.\n*   **Desktop Optimization:** Structured for 1440px width with considered whitespace and typography designed for maximum readability in low-light environments.\n\nWould you like to see the login page in this same dark theme, or should we move on to the admin dashboard and tables?"
