      "text": "I've designed the first step of your booking flow. This mobile-optimized screen focuses on selecting a play date with a clear, functional layout:\n\n### Design Highlights:\n- **Progress Tracking**: A prominent step indicator (1 of 4) keeps the user oriented within the booking journey.\n- **Date Strip**: A horizontal 14-day selection strip allows for quick, effortless choosing of immediate dates, using your primary brand green for the active selection.\n- **Visual Hierarchy**: Clean typography using DM Sans for headings and Inter for body copy ensures high readability against the soft #F4F7F5 background.\n- **Consistent Branding**: Integrated the global top and bottom navigation bars to maintain the CourtPass identity.\n\nHow does this look for the first step? We can proceed to Step 2: Time Selection, or adjust the date strip functionality."
