            "prompt": "Create a desktop booking screen (Step 1 of 4) for CourtPass Sheikh Zayed.\nTitle: CourtPass book-date desktop light.\nLayout: 1440px wide desktop view with a 1200px max-width container. \nStyle: Light mode, bg #F4F7F5, primary #1B7A4E. Professional and clean.\nComponents:\n- Progress indicator: Step 1 of 4 at the top.\n- Left Sidebar: A date-selection strip or calendar summary for quick navigation.\n- Main Content Area: A large, interactive month-view calendar. Current date is highlighted. Slots availability indicators on specific dates.\n- Interaction: A \"Next: Select Time\" primary button in the bottom right, using #1B7A4E.\n- Header: Use the TopNavBar component.\n- Footer: Use the Footer component.\nInclude the CourtPass logo {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_39}} and ensure the design feels premium and athletic.\n## Available Images\nYou MUST include the following images in this design. You must reference them\nby putting their exact placeholder IDs in `src` attributes or CSS\n`background-image` rules. Do NOT use external URLs or generate new\nplaceholders. Preserve these IDs exactly as written. Read each image's\nDescription to understand its subject, intended section, and visual role.\n\n- {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_39}}\n  Description: CourtPass logo: A minimal padel racket icon followed by the wordmark 'CourtPass' in DM Sans. Professional, sporty, and clean. Colors: #1B7A4E and #0F1A14.\n  Dimensions: 1024x1024\n  Aspect Ratio: 1.00\n",
