      "text": "I've designed the desktop date selection screen for the CourtPass booking flow.\n\n### Design Decisions\n- **Layout & Structure**: Implemented a professional 1440px desktop layout with a centered 1200px container for optimal readability. \n- **Calendar & Sidebar**: Combined a comprehensive month-view calendar with a \"Quick Select\" date strip in the sidebar, allowing staff or players to navigate dates with high efficiency.\n- **Visual Language**: Applied the light mode palette (bg: `#F4F7F5`, cards: `#FFFFFF`) with the `#1B7A4E` brand green for primary actions and status indicators, ensuring high professional contrast.\n- **Information Hierarchy**: Placed the progress indicator clearly at the top, followed by a logical left-to-right flow for date selection, culminating in a prominent \"Next: Select Time\" call-to-action.\n\nThe screen is now published to your canvas as **CourtPass book-date desktop light**. How would you like to proceed with the \"Select Time\" step?"
